Comment: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:12.33,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法夺走的Story
Comment: 0,0:01:12.33,0:01:14.25,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就只是一人独自生存
Comment: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:16.17,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外出便是暴风雨Stormy
Comment: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:17.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钟声响起 Ding Ding Dong
Comment: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:18.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Like a King Kong
Comment: 0,0:01:18.63,0:01:21.89,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Top 10的任务 完成后自己就是队长
